    "kit：server/sim/content/kits/reserve-wisdel.js（并在 kits/reserve.js 里接线）",
    "每条技能一条\"先红后绿\"探针（AGENTS §三）",
    "素材引用：avatar / portrait / spine / skillIcon 四条在磁盘上真的存在（b-verify-asset-refs.mjs）",
